lingmo-dm (5.0.2+lingmo5u1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * dm: add lingmo-dm-autologin PAM service that uses pam_permit instead
    of common-auth so autologin works regardless of the account's shadow
    state.  The daemon now uses autologinService (defaulting to
    lingmo-dm-autologin) for the passwordless autologin path, and keeps
    sessionService (lingmo-dm) only for password-authenticated logins.

 -- Lingmo OS Team <team@lingmo.org>  Wed, 04 Nov 2026 17:00:00 +0800

